QGC WPL 110
# GPS FAILURE BEHAVIOR MISSION v4
# Purpose-built nominal/fault trigger mission for the gps_failure lane.
# Geometry keeps the practical airspeed behavior lifecycle instead of the old
# 36 km long-line template, but extends the calm-lane settle point to 500 m.
# A v2 live nominal completed its 100 m climb around 323 m East; the former
# 300 m settle waypoint was then behind the aircraft and caused a full turnback
# loop. V3 fixed that settle point; v4 extends each measurement leg to 2000 m
# and increases reciprocal-lane spacing to 500 m. GPS faults still inject on
# entering seq 4 after front-half progress through seq 1 and seq 3; seq 2 may be
# skipped by MISSION_CURRENT.
#
# Home
0	1	0	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3632620	149.1652370	584.00	1
#
# WP1: TAKEOFF East, climb to 100 m AGL.
1	0	3	22	15.0	0	0	0	-35.3632620	149.1668924	100.00	1
#
# WP2: Command target speed = 15 m/s.
# MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED (178): param1=0, param2=15.
2	0	0	178	0	15.0	0	0	0	0	0	1
#
# WP3: Eastbound settle leg start, 500 m East of home.
3	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3632620	149.1707448	100.00	1
#
# WP4: Eastbound measurement leg end, 2500 m East of home.
# INJECTION POINT: fault/no-fault observation starts on entering seq 4.
4	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3632620	149.1927760	100.00	1
#
# WP5: North offset for reciprocal turn, 500 m North / 2500 m East.
5	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3587703	149.1927760	100.00	1
#
# WP6: Westbound measurement leg start, 500 m North / 2500 m East.
6	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3587703	149.1927760	100.00	1
#
# WP7: Westbound measurement leg end, 500 m North / 500 m East.
7	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3587703	149.1707448	100.00	1
#
# WP8: Return toward home, 500 m North of home.
8	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.3587703	149.1652370	100.00	1
#
# WP9: Return to launch. No landing sequence.
9	0	3	20	0	0	0	0	0	0	0	1
